      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eau_Claire%2C_Wisconsin",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Owen, Putnam, Carson, and Phoenix Parks line the Chippewa, Putnam Creek, Halfmoon Lake, and former steel plant, offering concerts and historic views.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
